@startuml swimlane_sv4_06_reports
title SV4-06 Dashboard, Ledger, Documents, Reports, Alerts (UC052, UC057 - UC060)

scale max 4000 width
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam ArrowColor #000000
skinparam conditionStyle InsideDiamond
skinparam roundCorner 0
skinparam swimlane {
  BorderColor #000000
  TitleBackgroundColor #66BBE2
  TitleFontStyle bold
}
skinparam activity {
  BackgroundColor white
  BorderColor #000000
  DiamondBackgroundColor #FFF8DC
  DiamondBorderColor #000000
}
skinparam note {
  BackgroundColor #FFFFE0
  BorderColor #999999
}

|Accountant|
|LocalPress Backend|
|Chief Accountant|

|Accountant|
start
:Log in to finance back office;
|LocalPress Backend|
:Cash flow dashboard (UC052): revenue = SUCCESS
excluding REFUND and TOPUP, order counts;
|Accountant|
:Open ledger (UC058): filter by status,
type, method, date, keyword;
|LocalPress Backend|
:Summary: gross, refunded, net;
|Accountant|
:Open an order detail;
if (Order PAID (SUCCESS)?) then (yes)
  :Print invoice / document (UC057)
or propose refund (SV4-05);
else (no)
  :No invoice button
(PENDING / FAILED / REFUNDED);
endif
|LocalPress Backend|
:Alerts (UC060): refunds PENDING,
complaints OPEN, overdue ad debt;
note right
API /finance/alerts only, no screen yet
end note
|Accountant|
if (Any alert?) then (yes)
  :Open the linked queue
(refunds / complaints / orders);
else (no)
  :Nothing pending;
endif
:Export CSV report (UC059):
all transactions, UTF-8 for Excel;
note right
API only; fromDate / toDate
not applied yet
end note
|Chief Accountant|
:Review reports;
stop

@enduml
